<title>ITALY: Italy refinery runs fell 2.5 pct in Jan-Aug 1996.</title>
<headline>Italy refinery runs fell 2.5 pct in Jan-Aug 1996.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian refinery runs fell 2.5 percent in the first eight months of 1996, according to trade body Unione Petrolifera.</p>
<p>No individual absolute figures for crude or foreign semi-finished products were given.</p>
<p>    Category		  Mln tonnes	 vs year earlier</p>
<p>    Total			 56.8		    -2.5%</p>
<p>    Crude			   -		     +1.3%</p>
<p>    Foreign semi-finished     -		    -30.1%</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
</text>
